{
 "summary": "Checkout is failing because inventory POST /reserve is slow (p95 ~4.76s, ~2.5s self time in traces). Orders times out waiting on it and returns 504, and the gateway turns that into 502. The gateway deploy (1.4.2 -> 1.5.4 at 00:45:44Z) came after errors had already started at window start (00:44:14Z), so it is unlikely to be the cause.",
 "root_cause": {
  "statement": "Inventory POST /reserve (release 3.1.5) is responding very slowly, about 2.5s of self time per trace and p95 near 4.76s. Orders times out reserving inventory, returns 504, and the gateway fails checkout with 502. Inventory itself reports no 5xx, so its errors show up only upstream. Why inventory is slow is not established by the evidence.",
